{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 81419, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 56610, "uid": 93889, "type": 4, "title": "PVP攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1624766377, "updated_at": 1658221937, "updated_uid": 93889, "comment_at": 1681902667, "last_at": 1688390959, "comment_count": 122, "status": 1, "summary": "前言2022年7月19日更新拉属性以及点火石分析首先说面板属性，这个大部分人都是知道的，攻击力防御力HP自然不用说，这里着重说一下敏捷和暴击，面板属性的敏捷是指命中和闪避，也就是说命中+闪避=敏捷。暴", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632458405144_66706986.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_616/h_641/1069/93889/2022/6/19/75200.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 139, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 83215, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 94, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 81419, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">前言</div></div><br><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(183, 68, 211);\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">2022年7月19日更新拉</span></div></span></span><div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(183, 68, 211);\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\">属性以及点火石分析</div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\">首先说面板属性，这个大部分人都是知道的，攻击力防御力HP自然不用说，这里着重说一下敏捷和暴击，面板属性的敏捷是指命中和闪避，也就是说命中+闪避=敏捷。暴击则是增加暴击几率（10000点暴击等于百分之60暴击几率）暴击属性收益偏低（奶和盾同样会暴击）</div><div class=\"div-img\">PVP中血量优于防御，因为防御无法减少delbuff伤害（出血、中毒等）<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">敏捷提升命中和闪避但是不会增加delbuff的命中率<br style=\"\">同理防御也不会降低delbuff的伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">点火石红攻增加整体伤害，并不会增加delbuff伤害</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(22, 108, 215);\">红防增加技能防御，不会降低delbuff伤害，也不会降低被反射的伤害</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">红敏提升弱点伤害+少量提升N和SS技能伤害</span></span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(133, 3, 21);\">红爆增加暴击伤害和DS伤害</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">HP白攻白防白敏白爆直接增加进面板绿色属性里面</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">红色增幅属性别看数值不多，但是计算效果非常强远超白色词条</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">需要知道的是主要词条增幅值为400副词条红色增幅为300</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624780059527_73039542.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624780059527_73039542.png\" data-width=\"553\" data-height=\"330\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\">上图黄框部分为天子自身加值以及温泉属性总和</div><div class=\"div-img\">绿色部分为装备白值以及附魔变化属性+魂卡白值+点火石白色词条属性总和</div><div class=\"div-img\">值得说的是装备附魔词条例如把百分之3.5的HP转换为攻击力，是根据黄框内的属性变化来加到绿框里的。</div><div class=\"div-img\">红框内少量属性则是点火石红色词条带来的。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632455298668_61088928.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632455298668_61088928.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 167px;\" data-width=\"433\" data-height=\"145\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632458405144_66706986.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632458405144_66706986.png\" data-width=\"716\" data-height=\"432\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">队伍推荐2022.7.19</div></div><br><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">要先说明一下，目前天梯因为薇薇安的存在导致PVP的性质发生了质变，目前高分段PVP变成了一个谁先出手的游戏，先手有非常高概率获胜，下面我来解释一下为什么先手具有巨大优势。我们来看一下目前这个天梯主C。</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></div></span></div></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(222, 14, 241);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div></span></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/432881.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/432881.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"410\" data-height=\"133\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_410/h_133/1069/93889/2022/6/19/388707.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_410/h_133/1069/93889/2022/6/19/388707.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">S技能<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;薇薇安</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> 这个技能是目前是薇薇安最逆天的技能，咋一看好像就是普通控制技能，实际上这个技能一旦优先命中对方可能永远也动不了了，这个技能前段描述充能量-79.4，一旦命中直接人原地罚站技能条基本不动，后段过敏反应两次，这个就更牛B拉免疫异盾直接失效并造成伤害，这个技能的出现直接把PVP免疫盾角色直接按在地上锤，说的就是下面这三个人，他们拥有以往PVP必备的技能免疫异常盾，现在他们三个直接被薇薇安克死，所以现在5V5非常不推荐这三个人</span></span><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/444044.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/444044.png\" style=\"height: 70px; width: 70px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/355818.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/355818.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 67px; width: 67px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/945010.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/945010.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 65px; width: 65px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;免疫盾图标&nbsp;<img data-width=\"30\" data-height=\"31\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_30/h_31/1069/93889/2022/6/19/408440.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_30/h_31/1069/93889/2022/6/19/408440.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 46.1875px; width: 44.6837px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"415\" data-height=\"92\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_415/h_92/1069/93889/2022/6/19/393065.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_415/h_92/1069/93889/2022/6/19/393065.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">薇薇安大招虽然没有伤害但是就是牛B谁用谁知道，可以尝试设置薇薇安大招第一个释放</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"338\" data-height=\"58\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_58/1069/93889/2022/6/19/596700.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_338/h_58/1069/93889/2022/6/19/596700.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">薇薇安队长技能，也是PVP队长技中的佼佼者，与金星的加速35意义上差不多。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">队伍构成部分</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/662253.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/662253.png\" style=\"height: 77px; width: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/911330.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/911330.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 77px; width: 77px;\"><br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">主C薇薇安，技能设置S，魂卡推荐浪漫婚纱（束缚角色技能充能速度提高），值得一说饰品2号位异常命中30最好是有。下面是薇薇安推荐固定三个挂件</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/251348.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/251348.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/253290.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/253290.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/608816.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/608816.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">固定挂件1金星，技能设置SNN，魂卡推荐秋天枫叶（辅助职业技能加速），湿漉漉的夏天（闪避率），饰品2号位最好有异常闪避30<br><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/953089.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/953089.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/339015.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/339015.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/720362.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/720362.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">固定挂件2暗伞，技能设置S，魂卡推荐一起去玩水（闪避率），要攒积分吗（S技能伤害增加），有小伙伴问土星能不能替代暗伞，我要告诉你薇薇安没出天梯由老八统治的时候确实土星能替代暗伞，有时候比暗伞还好用，但是薇薇安一出来土星就不能替代暗伞了，薇薇安S克制土星免疫盾，相反暗伞可以解薇薇安的异常。<br><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/134599.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/134599.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/306300.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/306300.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/992416.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/992416.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/398931.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/1069/93889/2022/6/19/398931.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">固定挂件3格里拉，技能设置S，魂卡推荐秋天枫叶，湿漉漉的夏天，要攒积分吗</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">薇薇安队伍固定挂件就是这三个还有一个位置属于摇摆位没有固定的人选，下面是摇摆位推荐。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/571750.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/571750.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/103187.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/103187.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/692997.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/692997.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">常规摇摆位，小天鹅，老八，红莲&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 选这三个常规摇摆位队长技能设置金星。</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/614561.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/614561.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/435981.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/435981.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/666098.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/666098.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/236913.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/236913.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/764841.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/93889/2022/6/19/764841.png\" style=\"width: 77px; height: 77px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">玩弄队长技能的摇摆位，光击剑（对面队长技能失效），金币娘（敌方充能减少35）金币娘带仓鼠人偶设置队长技能发生质变敌方减速我方加速，库巴巴（敌方充能减少35）同样道理带嫦娥人偶敌方减速我方加速。这三个人主要是玩队长技能的且自身技能也契合PVP</div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">后记</div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(193, 58, 177);\"><div class=\"div-img\">以上就是目前主流队伍，还有以前的老队伍也能用打1W6还是简单比如以前的老八队，火队水队偶像队都可以继续使用，一代版本一代神，只能说PVP有风险投资需谨慎，萌新建议少研究PVP多去搞PVE受益比PVP来的多的多，PVP水很深你把握不住。有啥问题欢迎留言交流。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 2022.7.19<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">&nbsp;</span><img data-width=\"616\" data-height=\"641\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2